<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE topic PUBLIC "-//OASIS//DTD DITA Topic//EN" "topic.dtd">
<topic id="git-addon-open-project-gitignore">
    <title>Open ignore files</title>
    <body>
    <p>Git has two kinds of ignore files: <codeph>.gitignore</codeph> and global
        <codeph>ignore</codeph>. Use the .gitignore file to exclude files from repository or
      project-level version control, and the global <codeph>ignore</codeph> file to exclude files
      from version control across all repositories on your machine. </p>
    <p>To open ignore files, first go to the <uicontrol
        conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs0-git-staging-view"/> view.</p>
    <ul id="ul_aw5_s1y_jjc">
      <li>To open ignore files at any time, go to the <xref
          href="git-addon-git-staging-view-interface.dita#git-addon-git-staging-view-interface/section_git_staging_ellipsis_menu"
              ><uicontrol><image href="../img/Ellipsis18.png" id="image_cc4_bkg_njc"
            />Ellipsis</uicontrol> menu</xref> and select <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>. From the <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/> submenu, select
          <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-gitignore"/> or
          <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-ignore"/>. </li>
      <li>To open ignore files from an untracked resource, on <uicontrol
          conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/gs1-unstaged-files"/>,
        right-click an untracked file or folder to open the contextual menu. <ul id="ul_w4c_tlg_njc">
          <li>To open a project's <codeph>.gitignore</codeph>, select <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
            <b>></b>
            <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-gitignore"/>.<p>
              <fig id="fig_qtj_myd_mjc">
                <title>Opening the project .gitignore</title>
                <image href="../img/git-addon/staging/ignore/open_proj_gitignore.png"
                  id="image_fbq_vzd_mjc"/>
              </fig>
            </p></li>
          <li>To open the global <codeph>ignore</codeph> file, select <uicontrol
              conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/ignore"/>
            <b>></b>
            <uicontrol conref="uicontrol_terminology.dita#uicontrol_terminology/open-ignore"/>.
          </li>
        </ul></li>
    </ul>
    </body>
</topic>
